4.1.1. VAE A RCHITECTURE
The choice of VAE architecture in LDMs is critical and
often domain-specific. For example, Stable Diffusion (Rom[01;31m[Kbach[m[K et al., 2022) uses a hybrid architecture that combines
convolutional neural networks (CNNs) and 2d-attention for
image generation, while PLANNER (Zhang et al., 2023)
[36m[K--[m[K
arXiv:2301.12503, 2023.

Rom[01;31m[Kbach[m[K, R., Blattmann, A., Lorenz, D., Esser, P., and
