diffusion models. In Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF
[36m[K--[m[K
is equivalent to a special training schedule with the KL divergence term being fixed in the first stage, and then training
the denoising model in the second stage. The performance gain of separating the training process has been shown in the
image generation domain (Rom[01;31m[Kbach[m[K et al., 2022; Preechakul et al., 2022). In the section below, we provide the empirical
evaluation of this method for DNA sequence generation.

C. U-Net Configuration
U-Net is trained by sampling t from uniform distribution U [1,T ] and ε from N (0,I). We adopted the U-Net backbone
from LDM (Ho et al.; Liu et al., 2023; Ronneberger et al., 2015) to implement εθ (z t ,t). Cross-attention (Rom[01;31m[Kbach[m[K et al.,
2022) is added to each layer to enable the integration of conditional information, and self-attention (Vaswani et al., 2017)
is added to the middle layers to improve the expressive power of the network.
