We evaluate how accurate our implementation of the CoE (Center of Effect) algorithm performances by comparing the
results we get from [01;31m[KBeethoven[m[K’s string quartets with annotated ones from professional musicians [33]. This annotated
data is one of the most detailed set of musical analysis in the literature, it contains information about the key and chord
in functional harmony terminology for each measure in all the [01;31m[KBeethoven[m[K’s string quartets. Our CoE implementation
performs accurately in more than 68.43% of the measures in the corpus provided by [33].

